{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-4-1","title":"Proverbs 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Solomon persuades to wisdom, 14 and to shun wickedness. 20 He exhorts to sanctification.</p>\n<p>ye. 1:8; 6:20-23; Ps 34:11; 1Th 2:11,12 attend. 2:1-5; 5:1; 7:4; 8:32-36; 19:20; 22:17; Heb 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-2","title":"Proverbs 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>good. 8:6-9; 22:20,21; De 32:2; Job 33:3; Ps 49:1-3; Joh 7:16,17 1Ti 4:6; Tit 1:9 forsake. 1Ch 28:9; 2Ch 7:19; Ps 89:30-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-3","title":"Proverbs 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>2Sa 12:24,25; 1Ki 1:13-17; 1Ch 3:5; 22:5; 29:1; Jer 10:23; Ro 12:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-4","title":"Proverbs 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>He. 22:6; Ge 18:19; 1Ch 22:11-16; 28:9; Eph 6:4; 2Ti 1:5; 3:15 Let. 3:1; De 4:9; 6:6; Ps 119:11 keep. 7:2; Le 18:3-5; Isa 55:3; Joh 12:50; Heb 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-5","title":"Proverbs 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Get wisdom. 1:22,23; 2:2-4; 3:13-18; 8:5; 17:16; 18:1; 19:8; 23:23; Jas 1:5 neither. 2Ch 34:2; Job 23:11; Ps 44:18; 119:51,157</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-6","title":"Proverbs 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>love. 21,22; 2:10-12; Eph 3:17; 2Th 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-7","title":"Proverbs 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Wisdom is. Ec 7:12; 9:16-18; Mt 13:44-46; Lu 10:42; Php 3:8 with. 16:16; 21:6; Ps 49:16-20; Ec 2:4-9; 4:8; Mr 8:36,37; Lu 12:20 get understanding. Ps 119:104</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-8","title":"Proverbs 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>3:35; 22:4; 1Sa 2:30; 1Ki 3:5-13; Da 12:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-9","title":"Proverbs 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>give. 1:9; 3:22; 1Ti 2:9,10; 1Pe 3:4 a crown, etc. or, she shall compass thee with a crown ofglory. 16:31; Isa 28:5; Heb 2:7-9; 1Pe 5:4; Re 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-10","title":"Proverbs 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>my. 8:10; 19:20; Job 22:22; Jer 9:20; Joh 3:32,33; 1Th 2:13; 1Ti 1:15 the. 3:2,16; De 5:16; 6:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-11","title":"Proverbs 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>taught. 4; De 4:5; 1Sa 12:24; Ec 12:9 led. 8:6,9,20; Ps 23:3; 25:4,5; Ac 13:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-12","title":"Proverbs 4:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>thou goest. 6:22; 2Sa 22:37; Job 18:7,8; Ps 18:36 thou shalt. 19; 3:23; Ps 91:11,12; 119:165; Jer 31:9; Joh 11:9,10; Ro 9:32,33 1Pe 2:8; 1Jo 2:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-13","title":"Proverbs 4:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Take. 3:18; 23:23; Ac 2:42; 11:23; 1Th 5:21; Heb 2:1; Re 2:13; 12:11 let. Ge 32:26; So 3:4; Lu 24:27-29; Joh 4:39-42 she. 3:22; De 32:47; Ec 7:12; Joh 6:68</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-14","title":"Proverbs 4:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>1:10,15; 2:11,12; 9:6; 13:20; Ps 1:1; 26:4,5; 1Co 15:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-15","title":"Proverbs 4:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>5:8; 6:5; Ex 23:7; Job 11:14; 22:23; Isa 33:15; Eph 5:11; 1Th 5:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-16","title":"Proverbs 4:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>1:16; Ps 36:4; Isa 57:20; Mic 2:1; Lu 22:66; Joh 18:28; 2Pe 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-17","title":"Proverbs 4:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>9:17; 20:17; Job 24:5,6; Ps 14:4; Jer 5:26-28; Eze 22:25-29 Am 8:4-6; Mic 3:5; 6:12; Zep 3:3; Mt 23:14; Jas 5:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-18","title":"Proverbs 4:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>2Sa 23:4; Job 11:17; 23:10; Ps 84:7; Ho 6:3; Zec 14:6,7 Mt 5:14,16,45; Joh 8:12; 2Co 3:18; Php 2:15; 2Pe 1:19; 3:18 Re 21:23; 22:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-19","title":"Proverbs 4:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>1Sa 2:9; Job 5:14; 12:25; 18:5,6,18; Isa 59:9,10; Jer 13:16; 23:12 Mt 7:23; 15:14; Joh 12:35; 1Jo 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-20","title":"Proverbs 4:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>5:1; 6:20,21; 7:1; Ps 78:1; 90:12; Isa 55:3; Mt 17:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-21","title":"Proverbs 4:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>depart. 3:3,21 in the. 2:1; Ps 40:8; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-22","title":"Proverbs 4:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>life. 4,10 health. Heb. medicine. 3:8; *marg: 12:18; Jer 33:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-23","title":"Proverbs 4:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Keep. 22:5; 23:19; 28:26; De 4:9; Ps 139:23,24; Jer 17:9; Mr 14:38 Heb 12:15 with all diligence. Heb. above all keeping. 7; 3:21; 11:16; 13:3; Ec 5:13 for. Mt 12:35; 15:19; Mr 7:21-23; Jas 1:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-24","title":"Proverbs 4:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Put. Job 11:14; Eze 18:31; Eph 4:25-31; Col 3:8; Jas 1:21,26; 1Pe 2:1 a, etc. Heb. frowardness of mouth, and perverseness of lips. 8:8,13; 17:20; 1Ti 6:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-25","title":"Proverbs 4:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>23:5,33; Job 31:1; Ps 119:37; Mt 6:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-26","title":"Proverbs 4:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>Ponder. 5:6; Ps 119:59; Eze 18:28; Hag 1:5,7; Eph 5:15,17 let all thy ways be established. or, all thy ways shall beordered aright. Ps 37:23; 40:2; 1Th 3:13; 2Th 3:3; 1Pe 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-4-27","title":"Proverbs 4:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Turn. De 5:32; 12:32; 28:14; Jos 1:7 remove. 16:17; Isa 1:16; Ro 12:9</p>"}]}